[by:维尔日记]
[00:00.00]作词 : DPR IAN
[00:01.00]作曲 : DPR IAN
[00:14.54]The crowd has come to a halt 人潮不再涌动
[00:17.76]The birds won't sing for you anymore 鸟雀不会再为你鸣唱
[00:22.34]Not like before 一反常态
[00:24.53]
[00:25.82]When the trees are all burning 树木燃烧时
[00:29.03]All the stars will keep on turning 星移斗转
[00:32.44]And I know I won't stop searching 但我知道 我不会放弃寻觅
[00:35.69]For the moment when the world stopped for you 世界为你定格的片刻
[00:45.11]It stopped for you 世界因你静止
[00:50.57]
[00:50.71]Then the world came crashing down 世界已在瓦解
[00:57.28]And it's pulling you in now 正朝你席卷而来
[01:01.00]
[01:07.46]You know all the words to the play 这部剧的所有台词 你都了如指掌
[01:10.33]But all I wanted was you to stay 但我唯独想要你留下来
[01:13.11]
[01:13.59]Your time is running thin 随时间的消磨
[01:15.46]Cause I'm faling through the cracks under your floor 我对你的态度 也都成了疏忽
[01:20.02]
[01:20.38]How does it feel to be alive again? 再获新生 究竟是何种体验
[01:25.58]Stop holding on with your dear breath 别再屏住呼吸
[01:28.92]You're one step closer to me 你与我的距离 已更近一步
[01:31.52]
[01:31.67]On the ballroom extravaganza 在舞会盛宴上
[01:38.89]I know you won't find me anymore 我知道 尽管你永远注意不到我
[01:42.22]I tried to reach for you once more 但我仍会向你接近
[01:44.99]
[01:45.12]But the world came crashing to the ground 但当世界正在瓦解
[01:57.29]
[01:58.83]When the story comes to an end 故事即将进入结局
[02:02.19]Will it be the same again? 一切还会一尘不变吗
[02:05.26]
[02:05.41]When all the king's horsemen and all the king's men 当投入全部人力物力
[02:08.69]They couldn't put you back together again 都无法将你原本的模样找回
[02:11.64]
[02:11.78]Oh when the story comes to an end 那当故事即将告终时
[02:15.43]Will it be the same again to you? 一切对你来说 还会一样吗
[02:21.70]To you 于你而言
[02:25.30]
[02:25.47]When the story comes to an end 当故事即将结尾
[02:28.67]Will you be the same again at all? 你还会是曾经的模样吗
[02:34.87]At all 全然
[02:44.93]At all 全然